{"about_the_game":"Demo: Unlocks one weapon - Sword &amp; Shield<br>No Talent NPC or Armor NPC<br>Game content ends after the second layer<br><br>Traveler Arena is a lightly action-oriented roguelike adventure game set in a fictional gladiator world. Players will\u626e\u6f14 gladiators, continuously battling through a three-layer arena, experiencing rich randomness and replayability. Interact with enemies through the assault system, utilize treasure combinations to build unique and powerful builds, and enjoy the thrill of sweeping the battlefield once fully formed. Every choice will affect your growth path\u2014challenge the limits and become a legendary gladiator!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/extras/0bd26cc0ab090c6271207fec500ea138.webp?t=1760157846\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/extras/f65b85c3536a67b6edd50daf0909c1fb.avif?t=1760157846\" width=614 height=272 /></span><br><strong>After unbalancing an enemy, you can launch a dash to deal significant damage and knock down energy orbs. Collecting these orbs fills your ultimate ability gauge, creating a combat rhythm of continuous offense and resource cycling that is simple to operate yet strategic.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/extras/1d56143d80328fa77d4e7da3aab5e823.webp?t=1760157846\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/extras/9af798c6d0de57684c3f69193c94b9cc.avif?t=1760157846\" width=614 height=272 /></span><br><strong>Nearly 200 random treasures are available to acquire, each enhancing the gladiator's five base attributes. These attributes complement each other, offering rich combinations to help you build a unique and powerful build, experiencing the joy of continuous growth in battle.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/extras/b7ffab4a2cc0ce5ae2d8d5423f36ddf1.webp?t=1760157846\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/extras/ee48645ec11f2a20fa09d05d56e652b2.avif?t=1760157846\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><strong>The game is divided into three layers of arenas, each lasting ten days. Each day, you can choose to fight for different factions. Each battle increases the corresponding faction's reputation. For every five points of reputation accumulated, you can redeem that faction's exclusive treasure. Mission choices directly impact your growth path.</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028390?t=1760157846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028390?t=1760157846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/f8c738c3bde6b503d3589032545d7b4ad0eb92ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760157846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/f8c738c3bde6b503d3589032545d7b4ad0eb92ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760157846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Demo: Unlocks one weapon - Sword &amp; Shield<br>No Talent NPC or Armor NPC<br>Game content ends after the second layer<br><br>Traveler Arena is a lightly action-oriented roguelike adventure game set in a fictional gladiator world. Players will\