tem_assets/steam/apps/4028390/extras/b7ffab4a2cc0ce5ae2d8d5423f36ddf1.webp?t=1760157846\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/extras/ee48645ec11f2a20fa09d05d56e652b2.avif?t=1760157846\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><strong>The game is divided into three layers of arenas, each lasting ten days. Each day, you can choose to fight for different factions. Each battle increases the corresponding faction's reputation. For every five points of reputation accumulated, you can redeem that faction's exclusive treasure. Mission choices directly impact your growth path.</strong>","developers":["\u5192\u70df\u718a\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3063190","name":"Traveler Arena"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028390/d5ac6a2ba8a6fc0c864d3db62801d3e1e776114c/header.jpg?t=1760157846","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028390/1865878166/b9f1d3f7f098f1fc0eaba48cda7bf85ac8e20752/1760001904/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760155244","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028390/1865878166/b9f1d3f7f098f1fc0eaba48cda7bf85ac8e20752/1760001904/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760155244","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4028390/1865878166/b9f1d3f7f098f1fc0eaba48cda7bf85ac8e20752/1760001904/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760155244","id":257214737,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akama